Origin of this repository
-------------------------
The replicated key/value store components in this repository started as
coursework for CSE 452 (Distributed Systems), University of Washington,
Spring 2025. Some components were first developed jointly with a classmate.
Both parties agreed that the work in this repository is maintained as the
author's individual project; the original shared coursework repository is kept
separately.

Test harness and framework
--------------------------
The directory `jars/` contains the binaries of the testing framework ("dslabs")
and its dependencies, and `run-tests.py` is part of the same framework (original
author header preserved). The framework sources distributed with the course carry
an MIT licence header ("Copyright (c) 2018-2022 Ellis Michael"); that notice
applies to these files and must be kept with them. Third-party dependency
licences are listed in `jars/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt`.

The framework discovers test classes only in packages whose name starts with
"dslabs". For that reason `modules/test-entries/` contains thin entry classes in
the package `dslabs.cmws.entry`; all other code lives under `cmws.*`.

The course test suites under `modules/*/tst` were adapted from the course
handout (package names changed) and remain subject to the course's rules. This
repository is private and is not to be redistributed.

The HTTP gateway (`modules/gateway`) runs its cluster on the framework's in-process runtime
(`RunState`, part of the harness jars), so it is compiled together with the tests.
